---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Research - Luis Firl"
  description="Research interests of Luis Firl in systems biology, theoretical biophysics and scientific machine learning."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
      <h1>Understanding biological systems through models and computation.</h1>

      <p class="lead">
        My research interests lie at the intersection of systems biology,
        biophysical modeling, and machine learning. Currently, my work focuses
        on mechanistic models of cellular signaling, providing a starting point
        for exploring how biological knowledge and machine learning can
        complement one another.
      </p>

      <p class="lead">
        More broadly, I am interested in discovering patterns in biological
        data and connecting different perspectives on complex systems. These
        interests continue to evolve, with room for new questions and
        approaches across biology and computation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container research-grid">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h2>Systems Biology</h2>
        <p>
          Mathematical and computational models for understanding how
          interactions between biological components give rise to complex
          cellular dynamics.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h2>Theoretical Biophysics</h2>
        <p>
          Mechanistic and quantitative approaches to biological systems,
          with a particular interest in dynamical models and emergent behavior.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h2>Scientific Machine Learning</h2>
        <p>
          Machine learning methods that incorporate physical or biological
          knowledge rather than treating scientific systems purely as
          black-box prediction problems.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h2>Computational Modeling</h2>
        <p>
          Reproducible computational workflows for simulation, inference and
          analysis of complex biological models.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 7rem 0 5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    max-width: 1000px;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .research-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  article {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  article span {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  article h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 750px) {
    .research-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
